{"title":"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The addition below is incorrect. What is the largest digit that can be changed to make the addition correct?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d5811da144f460480e717433cef84ec3c9d8f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}{rr}&amp;\\ \\texttt{6 4 1}\\\\ &amp;\\texttt{8 5 2}\\\\ &amp;+\\texttt{9 7 3}\\\\ \\hline  &amp;\\texttt{2 4 5 6}\\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -29px\" width=\"101\" height=\"71\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/d/9cd1c186e0c8dce3b1694d839980a8f6fe5cd6ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ 5\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ 6\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ 7\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Doing the addition as is, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/98128b255ae9989cd477fe11777e2edf5595038a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$641 + 852 + 973 = 2466$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"186\" height=\"14\" />.  This number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> larger than the desired sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a94131fbbfbb96d802fe69c3349e76e692660716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2456$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore, we must make one of the three numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> smaller.\n</p><p>We may either change <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfb501c20d2960e7ac88b9077841f842c2b58304.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$641 \\rightarrow 631$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/a/ebab7f31de55907662c3380f2b6639d80cfeeae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$852 \\rightarrow 842$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc3c325427b5f9177083fc66e4038de380533c9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$973 \\rightarrow 963$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />.  Either change results in a valid sum.  The largest digit that could be changed is thus the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6b3843a72e20236ad81f1dee30fac8e5ca70c5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$973$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/167115c0a7d5bfef6dcf8aadc3c6cd40b145bc80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME\" title=\"1996 AHSME\">1996 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1996 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1996\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems